    "description": "一个非物理的软件控制组件，通过远程显微镜服务器连接电子显微镜。它用于读取 TEM/STEM 状态，调节束流、像移、倍率与工作模式，管理相机和探测器参数，并触发图像或信号采集。",
    "description_en": "A non-physical software proxy that connects to an electron microscope through a remote microscope server. It is used to read TEM/STEM status, adjust beam, image, magnification, and operating modes, manage camera and detector parameters, and trigger image or signal acquisition.",
